<title>SWEDEN: Reuters' Fifth ex-Stockholm cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters' Fifth ex-Stockholm cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Stockholm air cargo market rates per kg in Swedish crowns for a 100 kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>						     NOV 4	  OCT 9</p>
<p>		     UNITED STATES</p>
<p> STO-JFK					    9.75	   9.75</p>
<p> STO-CHI					   11.30	  11.30</p>
<p> STO-LAX					   12.70	  12.70</p>
<p>			ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p> STO-HKG					   13.30	  13.30</p>
<p> STO-SIN					   13.30	  13.30</p>
<p> STO-NRT					   19.40	  19.30</p>
<p> STO-BKK					   13.00	  13.00</p>
<p>			 MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> STO-DXB					   10.25	  10.25</p>
<p> STO-JNB					   20.10	  20.20</p>
<p>				EUROPE</p>
<p> STO-LON					    7.50	   7.70</p>
<p> STO-PAR					    7.30	   7.50</p>
<p>			LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p> STO-SAO					    20.80	 21.80</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at Stockholm's international Arlanda airport. *All prices quoted in Swedish crowns. *The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative or current market activity.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
